{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object found, then approach it and check properties. If in range, take object and do specific task. Finally, move to random location. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = SpecificTask    /> <Action ID = MoveToRandomLocation    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectFound    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectInRange    />",
